 *  (comma separated roles; blank: the standing rule); and the grace days (a whole number of days; blank: off; not dated); and the note threshold (blank: none); and the entry date (YYYY-MM-DD; blank: off; not dated); and the grace days of grades A, B and C (blank: none); and the proof thresholds of grades A, B and C (blank: none — the sheet's applies); and the pot (two decimals; blank: none; not dated); and the parent sheet (a sheet's id; blank: none; not dated); and the fiscal year start month (1 to 12; blank: 1; not dated); and the alert threshold (two decimals; blank: off; not dated); and the rounding mode (half-up or half-even; blank: none — a claim rounds by the policy date); and the review threshold (blank: none); and the escalation gap (a whole number of days; blank: off; not dated); a key left out (null) is not changed.
